                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Swords and Soldiers HD is a surprisingly entertaining take on the RTS genre. I like how it strips the genre down to the basics without making it completely brainless. You're mostly deciding which units to send out and when to use your abilities, while your little army does the actual fighting. The goofy factions and humour also give it plenty of personality and make the whole thing a lot of fun to play.\n",
